Key Features
🥗 Interactive Menu: Display of food categories with easy navigation.
📱 Responsive Design: Fully optimized for all devices, from desktops to smartphones.
🎨 Clean UI/UX: User-friendly interface with visually appealing design elements.
🛒 Order Now Section: CTA (Call-to-Action) buttons for user engagement.
🌐 Fast Performance: Deployed on Netlify for lightning-fast load times.

Applications
This project can be adapted for:

1.Online food ordering platforms.
2.Showcasing menus for restaurants, cafés, or cloud kitchens.
3.Portfolio projects for front-end developers.

Future Enhancements
Integration with Backend APIs for real-time food ordering functionality.
Cart System: Add-to-cart and checkout features for full e-commerce capabilities.
Search & Filters: Enable users to search and filter menu items by categories, price, or cuisine.
User Authentication: Allow customers to log in, view order history, and save preferences.
